{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45618","headline":"上裴大夫二首 二 · 贯休","name":"上裴大夫二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有白云琴，朴斲天地精。\n俚耳不使闻，虑同衆乐听。\n指指法仙法，声声圣人声。\n一弹四时和，再弹中古清。\n庭前梧桐枝，飒飒南风生。\n还希师旷怀，见我心不轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}